WEBVTT

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:54.050
We're together now.

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:27.390
"A break-in,

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:30.220
followed by a struggle, a crack in the gas line,

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:31.390
and then an explosion..."

00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:34.230
"Fortunately, damage was minimal,

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:35.920
and there were no deaths.

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:38.230
The building itself sustained only minor damage.

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:41.610
The burglar escaped."

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:43.590
I don't think a robber entering through

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:45.880
an eighth-story window is very credible, do you?

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:48.910
But there were signs that someone did do that.

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:52.460
And the next door neighbor heard a really loud noise.

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:55.670
He's at N University?

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:57.090
Hmm?...

00:03:57.090 --> 00:04:00.300
Isn't your daughter at NU, too, Karahari-san?

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:02.760
Is your daughter doing well?

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:05.430
What's wrong?

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:06.940
Don't even ask.

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:10.020
I don't even want to think about it.

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:14.020
Barricade ourselves inside?

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:16.520
What are you saying, Chief?

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:19.490
I heard the school will

00:04:19.490 --> 00:04:21.240
enter by force tomorrow.

00:04:21.670 --> 00:04:23.530
We fight to the last!

00:04:24.310 --> 00:04:26.730
Chief, please reconsider this...

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:29.270
We're the ones using the building 
without permission.

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:30.410
We're in the wrong.

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:32.050
What?!

00:04:32.050 --> 00:04:34.090
How long do you think it's taken me

00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:35.870
to set up all this equipment here?

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:38.970
I can't just hand it over.

00:04:38.970 --> 00:04:41.890
But what are you researching, anyway?

00:04:41.890 --> 00:04:43.400
Plasma? Auras?

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:45.000
It's all crazy stuff.

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:47.180
Yes, that's exactly it!

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:50.180
The world contains tons and tons of crazy mysteries.

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:52.530
Our job is to scientifically explain each of them,

00:04:52.530 --> 00:04:54.220
and use them to destroy the

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:57.190
so-called science that dominates 
the rest of the world!

00:04:57.440 --> 00:05:00.710
That is the True-Science Club's investigative mission!

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:02.860
Bring on the crazy, I say!

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:06.490
<b>Episode 2</b>

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:06.490
<b>A God's Training</b>

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:13.410
Okay, good work.

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:14.290
Once more.

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:19.310
I'm glad we have a place like this.

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:22.380
Yeah, we can't train with other people around.

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:28.670
Utao-chan, you're really good!

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:33.750
I'm sorry. Could you not talk to her too much?

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:35.060
I'm sorry.

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:39.680
You idiot!

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:41.570
Don't lose your focus over a single compliment!

00:05:42.010 --> 00:05:43.890
Concentrate! Concentrate!

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:48.550
I thought a god would be a little more impressive.

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:52.370
We don't really know much about them.

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:54.640
In the village, the means 
to control them is passed down.

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:56.370
To control them?

00:05:56.780 --> 00:05:59.730
Certain people are chosen for 
the special position of a Seki.

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:02.380
They put their soul into the kakashi and control them.

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:05.630
For years, we've used them to help

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:09.390
with logging and building, or to repel enemies.

00:06:09.890 --> 00:06:12.640
Then, that person who you said ran away...

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:16.610
Yeah. He's had the talent since he was little,

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:18.890
but there were problems with his personality.

00:06:19.610 --> 00:06:21.800
Is he still...

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:24.020
He should be imprisoned.

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:28.010
That's the only thing we can do...

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:35.820
Hey, want some lunch?

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:40.290
Without more time, this was all I could make.

00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:43.170
Here you go.

00:06:45.390 --> 00:06:46.550
Thanks!

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:51.370
It's great!

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:54.660
These are really great!

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:57.140
We have plenty of them, so eat up.

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:00.300
<i>Is this a dream?</i>

00:07:00.300 --> 00:07:02.310
<i>I'm eating a handmade lunch,</i>

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:03.810
<i>Hibino-san made for me.</i>

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:06.750
<i>If only we were alone...</i>

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:10.770
<i>No, Utao is the only reason I'm here.</i>

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:12.930
Utao-chan!

00:07:19.650 --> 00:07:21.480
You were that hungry?

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:23.580
You ate breakfast, right?

00:07:24.050 --> 00:07:28.340
Controlling a kakashi takes a ton of energy.

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:32.880
Hey, were you also a Seki, Kuga-kun?

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:35.350
Yeah...

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:40.120
I used to control Kukuri.

00:07:41.130 --> 00:07:44.710
I got fired because I didn't have enough talent,

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:46.400
so Utao took my place.

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:49.690
I think it was for the best.

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:53.640
She's better at putting her heart into the kakashi.

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:55.780
When someone like me does it...

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:59.650
But I am a bit surprised.

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:04.290
My first impression of you was 
that you were a little wimpy.

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:09.430
But when Utao-chan's around, 
you really do act like an older brother.

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:12.050
W-Was that a compliment?

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:15.930
<i>I'm having a hard time feeling good about it.</i>

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:19.060
Quit the club?

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:24.040
You're my last slave... I mean, member.

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:25.300
Um...

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:26.340
Member A!

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:28.340
You don't even know my name...

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:30.950
It's not important.

00:08:30.950 --> 00:08:33.070
I'm just a lackey! A slave!

00:08:33.430 --> 00:08:35.830
Every day, I have to run your personal errands.

00:08:35.830 --> 00:08:38.100
Then there's the crazy stuff 
I have to do for club funds,

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:40.100
and now we're fighting the school?!

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:41.140
Yeah, yeah.

00:08:41.140 --> 00:08:44.730
It took me two years to get into this school.

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:46.460
After all that, I won't get expelled!

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:50.460
Don't point at people.

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:52.720
I'm quitting.

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:57.470
No matter what you say, I'm quitting today...

00:08:57.860 --> 00:09:00.080
Oh, hold on...

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:02.110
Rethink it.

00:09:02.110 --> 00:09:07.480
I'll let you have some fun...

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:08.860
Don't!

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:12.360
You're not seducing me!

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:16.820
Wait!

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:28.420
Hey! Leave the car!

00:09:27.650 --> 00:09:30.090
It's my car!

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:30.090
Shut up!

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:33.700
Give me the car!

00:09:33.700 --> 00:09:35.470
No...

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:45.220
It wasn't me!

00:09:45.220 --> 00:09:47.020
That was the club area...

00:09:48.110 --> 00:09:48.810
Kyohei!

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:50.890
Okay, be careful.

00:09:50.890 --> 00:09:52.730
Don't let anyone see you.

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:02.420
What...

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:06.870
Hey, slave!

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:08.450
Wake up!

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:11.960
This is bad...

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:16.300
Hey! Idiot!

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:17.220
Wake up!

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:18.720
Useless, little...

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:24.720
What?

00:10:27.670 --> 00:10:28.560
Kuga-kun?

00:10:28.860 --> 00:10:29.760
Dummy!

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:31.820
Just remove the door!

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:36.820
Calm down.

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:49.830
<i>I've got to do it right...</i>

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:51.580
<i>Kyohei's watching.</i>

00:10:52.310 --> 00:10:53.460
<i>Don't screw up!</i>

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:00.250
Hey!

00:11:00.570 --> 00:11:01.940
Kyohei...

00:11:02.940 --> 00:11:05.970
Kyohei... Do you not like the kakashi?

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:09.280
I shouldn't have come, right?

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:11.350
This isn't the time!

00:11:19.640 --> 00:11:21.030
That's not true.

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:24.660
I was happy to see you again.

00:11:39.530 --> 00:11:40.560
What?

00:11:47.780 --> 00:11:49.290
You did well.

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:55.190
I see...

00:11:55.710 --> 00:11:57.570
So it's a god, huh?

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:03.380
You idiot, don't stop concentrating!

00:12:25.920 --> 00:12:27.890
What was that?

00:12:56.810 --> 00:12:58.670
Um...

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:00.880
Hibino-san...

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:03.590
Hibino-san, wait!

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:05.440
I'm sorry.

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:06.740
I'm so sorry!

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:07.880
I was wrong!

00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:11.410
I just... I wasn't thinking.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:16.200
It's all right, already.

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:19.110
But we need to lay down some rules.

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:20.650
Since we're living together.

00:13:21.770 --> 00:13:23.770
Yes, we are living together, right?

00:13:23.770 --> 00:13:29.020
Anyway, is it okay for Utao-chan 
to stay home all the time?

00:13:29.020 --> 00:13:31.660
Yeah, don't worry about it.

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:34.040
Correspondence course?

00:13:34.530 --> 00:13:37.240
Yes. Only Seki are allowed to do it.

00:13:37.240 --> 00:13:38.790
And only through our village.

00:13:39.570 --> 00:13:41.790
That's all for today...

00:13:43.190 --> 00:13:46.000
But is that really enough?

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:49.300
She's actually good at studying.

00:13:50.130 --> 00:13:51.810
Hey, you two seem to be getting along.

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:53.610
Oh, Kuuko.

00:13:53.610 --> 00:13:55.090
May I sit down?

00:13:57.090 --> 00:13:57.810
Hibino-san?

00:13:58.690 --> 00:13:59.560
What?

00:13:59.820 --> 00:14:02.230
That's the person we saved with Kukuri!

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:04.360
It was Kuuko?

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:07.480
Hey, you really are getting along.

00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:11.080
I guess the rumor's finally coming true.

00:14:11.360 --> 00:14:12.480
Rumor?

00:14:12.900 --> 00:14:16.150
That after all those rejections,

00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:18.080
someone finally got Hibino to date them.

00:14:18.360 --> 00:14:19.240
What?

00:14:19.240 --> 00:14:20.460
What?!

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:21.630
That's not true at all, Kuuko!

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:23.550
Kuga-kun and I totally aren't...

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:24.360
<i>Immediate denial?</i>

00:14:24.360 --> 00:14:26.130
He has some problems at home...

00:14:26.480 --> 00:14:28.750
<i>Judging by the strength of her denial,</i>

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:31.570
<i>she must have some feelings for him.</i>

00:14:31.910 --> 00:14:34.410
<i>She didn't have to be so firm about it.</i>

00:14:34.410 --> 00:14:37.140
<i>And I guess the guy's just an idiot.</i>

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:42.080
So you're from the same village?

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:42.900
That's right.

00:14:43.340 --> 00:14:46.230
Anyway, you must have had a hard time.

00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:48.170
I heard your clubhouse caught fire.

00:14:48.170 --> 00:14:50.190
Oh, how did you know?

00:14:51.630 --> 00:14:54.680
I didn't think anyone's really mentioned it.

00:14:54.680 --> 00:14:57.580
But yeah, that was a real screw-up...

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:00.130
Are you okay? Will you be disciplined?

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:02.240
They really yelled at me.

00:15:02.240 --> 00:15:04.210
But you know...

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:06.670
There are lots of ways to deal with that stuff.

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:08.100
You haven't changed.

00:15:08.100 --> 00:15:09.340
Anyway!

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:11.170
I saw it!

00:15:11.170 --> 00:15:12.090
What?

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:14.850
A big scarecrow monster!

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:32.290
My shoulders hurt.

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:38.290
<i>Do something about that clumsiness of yours!</i>

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:42.830
Okay!

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:45.090
<i>Concentrate. Concentrate.</i>

00:15:57.860 --> 00:15:59.660
What was that sound?

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:01.160
Are you all right?

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:02.470
I-It's nothing!

00:16:02.470 --> 00:16:03.890
I just tripped!

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:05.450
But the whole house shook.

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:07.140
U-Um...

00:16:07.310 --> 00:16:09.190
D-Did you need something?

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:12.450
Yeah, would you help me with the store for a bit?

00:16:12.930 --> 00:16:14.820
Sure, I'll be right there.

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:15.820
Thanks.

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:25.760
The slave who was with me

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:28.500
said he didn't see the scarecrow monster.

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:31.130
He was passed out the entire time.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:33.670
Weren't you unconscious, too, Karahari-san?

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:35.510
Could you have dreamed it?

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:38.470
I thought of that, too.

00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:41.260
But if someone did come and save me,

00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:43.690
why not call in to report the fire?

00:16:44.640 --> 00:16:45.780
I guess so...

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:50.960
Kyosuke!

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:52.440
Oh, it's you?

00:16:52.830 --> 00:16:54.230
She called him by name, right?

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:56.750
An older boyfriend?

00:16:56.750 --> 00:16:57.740
It's possible.

00:16:57.740 --> 00:17:02.460
I've told you before, call me "Father."

00:17:02.460 --> 00:17:04.050
So they're father and daughter.

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:05.890
Father and daughter!

00:17:05.890 --> 00:17:08.750
Father, my ass. Stupid Kyosuke...

00:17:09.140 --> 00:17:10.370
What are you doing at school?

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:12.310
I'm sure you can guess.

00:17:12.310 --> 00:17:13.170
Yeah.

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:14.380
The explosion, huh?

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:15.680
Don't "yeah" me!

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:16.750
It's a huge pain for me!

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:19.720
Why does a detective's daughter

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:21.640
have to be such a delinquent?

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:24.480
Consider your father's position for once!

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:27.970
Father? Hah!

00:17:27.970 --> 00:17:28.890
Let's go!

00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:30.270
We're wasting time here!

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:32.150
You're...

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:36.330
D-Did you need something?

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:40.660
He offered to take us back by car.

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:42.910
Shouldn't we have taken him up on it?

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:45.780
He's a detective, right?

00:17:45.780 --> 00:17:48.040
I don't want him figuring out anything about us.

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:51.690
From now on, we have to be more careful.

00:17:52.270 --> 00:17:53.830
Aren't you worrying too much?

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:57.140
It's mean, but I don't think 
you're being careful. You're being...

00:17:57.140 --> 00:17:58.340
Cowardly?

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:03.180
When dealing with kakashi, that's for the best.

00:18:06.260 --> 00:18:09.440
Kuga-kun, don't you really want to be a Seki again?

00:18:10.830 --> 00:18:13.150
When you were giving Utao-chan lessons,

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:16.150
it felt like you wanted to 
control the kakashi yourself.

00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:20.860
I really don't want anything to do with them.

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:23.580
Not the kakashi... Or the village.

00:18:24.260 --> 00:18:25.580
Or Utao-chan?

00:18:25.970 --> 00:18:26.870
Yeah.

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:31.670
I hope she doesn't get hurt.

00:18:32.270 --> 00:18:33.900
The power of the kakashi

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:36.550
brings disaster, regardless of what you want.

00:18:37.060 --> 00:18:40.430
Did something like that happen to you, Kuga-kun?

00:18:42.810 --> 00:18:47.270
An uncontrollable power should not be used.

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:50.810
It brings misery both to the person who uses it,

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:53.000
and to those it is used upon.

00:18:53.600 --> 00:18:56.820
I don't want that happening to Utao.

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:03.160
We're back.

00:19:09.190 --> 00:19:10.540
Welcome home.

00:19:11.510 --> 00:19:13.470
What's with that outfit?

00:19:13.470 --> 00:19:14.330
I was helping

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:15.700
in Hibino's place.

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:18.470
She helped out when we were busy, at lunch.

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:21.530
And she was surprisingly popular,

00:19:21.530 --> 00:19:23.050
so I had her keep doing it.

00:19:23.530 --> 00:19:25.200
Did you get any orders wrong?

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:26.590
How many plates did you break?

00:19:26.590 --> 00:19:29.100
I didn't get any wrong, and I didn't break any plates!

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:31.220
Only a couple.

00:19:31.220 --> 00:19:32.340
How about it?

00:19:32.340 --> 00:19:36.250
Why don't we put you in a real 
maid uniform, instead of that thing?

00:19:36.250 --> 00:19:37.080
You'll be popular.

00:19:37.080 --> 00:19:37.780
No!

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:40.290
That's true. She'd look great.

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:42.240
Why not come shopping with me tomorrow?

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:44.830
No! Never!

00:19:50.670 --> 00:19:51.900
Hey, Dad...

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:55.780
Do you know what happened 
to Kuga-kun in the past?

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:58.710
Not really.

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:01.650
Since I came here,

00:20:01.650 --> 00:20:04.370
I've had almost no contact with the village.

00:20:04.790 --> 00:20:08.680
If something comes up, they contact me.

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:10.950
But I don't know what goes on there.

00:20:12.530 --> 00:20:14.260
Did something happen?

00:20:14.260 --> 00:20:15.230
No.

00:20:19.740 --> 00:20:21.850
<i>He had a mysterious look to his eyes...</i>

00:20:23.480 --> 00:20:25.020
Aw, jeez!

00:20:25.560 --> 00:20:26.790
What's wrong?

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:30.960
Utao?

00:20:32.420 --> 00:20:33.710
Not here?

00:20:40.870 --> 00:20:45.430
Hey, how many years has it been?

00:20:46.150 --> 00:20:48.990
Well? You think Utao will be a good Seki?

00:21:12.390 --> 00:21:15.830
You can't really see the stars here.

00:21:21.060 --> 00:21:22.210
That's true...

00:21:22.790 --> 00:21:26.340
If Kyohei's here, that's enough.

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:44.240
<i>Aki!</i>

00:21:44.380 --> 00:21:48.620
<i>Aki!</i>

00:21:51.490 --> 00:21:53.030
<i>Cowardly or not...</i>

00:21:53.030 --> 00:21:54.200
<i>Pathetic or not...</i>

00:21:55.090 --> 00:21:57.830
<i>I don't want to see a lot of people die.</i>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:47.230
<b>Kamisama 
Dolls</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:47.230
<b>Corner</b>

00:23:35.460 --> 00:23:36.990
It's Kamisama Dolls Corner time!

00:23:36.990 --> 00:23:38.460
You're spinning too much, Kukuri!

00:23:38.460 --> 00:23:40.600
Today, we'll talk about controlling Kukuri.

00:23:38.600 --> 00:23:40.520
<b>Kukuri 
Control 
Manual</b>

00:23:40.600 --> 00:23:42.090
You can go, like Un! Or Don!

00:23:41.980 --> 00:23:43.650
<b>Secret 
Kukuri 
Control 
Manual</b>

00:23:42.090 --> 00:23:43.200
We learned a lot but,

00:23:43.200 --> 00:23:44.480
when you get stuck, it's just spirit.

00:23:43.830 --> 00:23:44.710
<b>Spirit!</b>

00:23:44.480 --> 00:23:46.810
And maybe up, up, down, down, left, right, left, right?

00:23:46.810 --> 00:23:48.360
Next time: It Attacks.

00:23:47.230 --> 00:23:49.900
<b>Next Episode: 
It Attacks...</b>

00:23:48.360 --> 00:23:49.900
Make sure to watch it.

